cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its ideas, please cite the paper below."
title: "Qantara: Bridge-Flow Training for Multi-Paradigm JEPA Control"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end JEPA world model whose joint training objective pairs a
  Brownian-bridge interpolant on the state axis with noise-to-data flow matching
  on the action axis. A single checkpoint serves three inference paradigms without
  retraining: latent planning, behaviour-cloning action sampling, and video-inverse
  dynamics.
